WEBVTT

00:01:33.980 --> 00:01:35.610
I've been longing to see you,

00:01:36.320 --> 00:01:37.820
Fujiko.

00:01:47.500 --> 00:01:49.910
<i>Can you hear me, Mine Fujiko?</i>

00:01:51.880 --> 00:01:52.880
Is that Lupin?

00:01:54.250 --> 00:01:56.710
It's been slashed to pieces!

00:01:56.710 --> 00:01:59.090
Who the hell did this?

00:02:03.970 --> 00:02:06.600
Come on, Mine Fujiko.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:10.940
I know you don't lose heart that easily.

00:02:11.770 --> 00:02:13.100
I...

00:02:13.650 --> 00:02:16.110
Pay no mind to him, Fujiko.

00:02:17.570 --> 00:02:20.110
I'll punish you if you do.

00:02:26.450 --> 00:02:27.370
<i>There you go.</i>

00:02:28.500 --> 00:02:31.120
<i>Your puppet strings have been cut.</i>

00:02:31.120 --> 00:02:34.880
<i>A woman who acts like a puppet is no fun.</i>

00:02:34.880 --> 00:02:37.670
<i>Show me your strength.</i>

00:02:37.670 --> 00:02:40.880
My... strength...

00:02:40.880 --> 00:02:41.880
That's right.

00:02:41.880 --> 00:02:45.890
If you're the mighty fine woman I
think you are, you should be able to.

00:02:45.890 --> 00:02:49.520
Mighty fine... woman...

00:02:51.850 --> 00:02:53.650
Right.

00:02:54.020 --> 00:02:57.650
I'm not here to kill myself.

00:02:58.650 --> 00:03:00.190
Fujiko!

00:03:00.190 --> 00:03:03.400
I'm here to kill...

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:07.830
Luis Yu Almeida!

00:03:09.740 --> 00:03:10.830
I...

00:03:11.410 --> 00:03:13.410
I will end my nightmare here and now!

00:03:14.330 --> 00:03:15.920
Put that down, Fujiko!

00:03:27.470 --> 00:03:29.850
Wh-What is that?!

00:03:31.060 --> 00:03:32.350
<i>Now, now. Settle down.</i>

00:03:32.350 --> 00:03:33.890
Lupin!

00:03:34.600 --> 00:03:37.150
<i>Then take a look at your heel.</i>

00:03:41.820 --> 00:03:45.150
The marks branded on my feet...

00:03:45.910 --> 00:03:47.370
<i>Mine Fujiko.</i>

00:03:48.070 --> 00:03:50.950
<i>The sole of your feet has always been clean.</i>

00:03:53.120 --> 00:03:55.460
This entire building is monitored

00:03:55.460 --> 00:03:58.880
except for one room.

00:03:58.880 --> 00:04:00.840
There, we'll find the one who'll go,

00:04:00.840 --> 00:04:06.340
"You've found me, the true mastermind!"

00:04:07.340 --> 00:04:09.100
The true mastermind?

00:04:09.760 --> 00:04:12.310
Don't let the past bog you down.

00:04:12.310 --> 00:04:13.770
Right now, you're...

00:04:16.900 --> 00:04:18.270
Jigen, don't inhale it! It's...

00:04:22.400 --> 00:04:23.820
An owl?

00:04:23.820 --> 00:04:25.360
One of Almeida's minions!

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.820
Jigen, calm down!

00:04:31.330 --> 00:04:32.450
Hold it!

00:04:39.080 --> 00:04:41.350
This is an atrocity!

00:04:41.920 --> 00:04:46.880
Every woman here had their appearances changed to look like Mine Fujiko.

00:04:47.880 --> 00:04:50.890
And Oscar, you too—

00:04:56.680 --> 00:04:58.140
Oscar!

00:04:58.140 --> 00:04:59.100
Stop it!

00:04:59.100 --> 00:05:00.860
Remember it, Oscar!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:05.360
The pride with which you defended that one fran coin!

00:05:08.570 --> 00:05:09.530
Oscar!

00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:25.460
It's you!

00:05:29.720 --> 00:05:31.220
Mine Fujiko!

00:05:32.390 --> 00:05:38.940
In order to perfect my swordsmanship,
I wished to determine who you truly are.

00:05:38.940 --> 00:05:40.400
And I finally did.

00:05:40.400 --> 00:05:43.230
Who I truly am?

00:05:43.230 --> 00:05:45.530
Yes, your true identity is...

00:05:47.190 --> 00:05:49.530
my girlfriend.

00:05:53.570 --> 00:05:55.660
Go, girlfriend!

00:05:59.080 --> 00:06:01.460
Found you, owl man!

00:06:04.670 --> 00:06:08.670
I'd rather not hear an owl man call me an owl man.

00:06:09.050 --> 00:06:10.970
You took the words right out of my mouth.

00:06:23.650 --> 00:06:25.520
There aren't any stairs?

00:06:26.570 --> 00:06:29.030
How am I supposed to get to the top?

00:06:32.910 --> 00:06:35.410
There are letters written on the wall.

00:06:42.330 --> 00:06:45.330
“You must not come”?

00:06:51.550 --> 00:06:52.510
This is...

00:06:53.550 --> 00:06:55.010
What is your name?

00:06:56.390 --> 00:06:57.770
“I won't tell you.”

00:06:58.350 --> 00:07:01.020
This is how you do it.

00:07:01.020 --> 00:07:03.900
You selfish, mischievous girl.

00:07:03.900 --> 00:07:06.020
Almeida's upset with you.

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:13.530
Papa, I'm sorry. Forgive me. I'll do anything.

00:07:13.530 --> 00:07:15.870
Papa, Papa, Papa...

00:07:15.870 --> 00:07:17.280
Now's our chance!

00:07:17.280 --> 00:07:26.750
Papa, Papa, Papa...

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:30.340
Sorry. I'm sorry, Papa...

00:07:35.180 --> 00:07:36.340
Well...

00:07:36.340 --> 00:07:38.550
We meet at last.

00:07:45.940 --> 00:07:47.360
Who is she?

00:07:50.270 --> 00:07:51.530
Fujiko!

00:07:52.070 --> 00:07:54.490
Wait, what is this?

00:07:54.490 --> 00:07:58.780
Fujiko, the old man you were talking with earlier...

00:07:58.780 --> 00:08:00.870
had this in his mouth.

00:08:02.790 --> 00:08:05.000
A speaker?

00:08:05.410 --> 00:08:07.630
Those letters on the wall, too.

00:08:07.630 --> 00:08:11.380
That device tracks her eye movements,

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:14.590
processes them and sends the messages.

00:08:18.340 --> 00:08:20.720
Here's a little story from the past.

00:08:21.510 --> 00:08:28.100
Luis Yu Almeida was running private experiments using Fraulein Eule.

00:08:28.100 --> 00:08:30.110
To be exact, experiments on humans

00:08:30.110 --> 00:08:34.240
to test memory alteration through intense brainwashing.

00:08:34.860 --> 00:08:39.160
Many girls were brought for this experiment.

00:08:39.570 --> 00:08:43.490
Almeida set his eyes on one particular girl among them.

00:08:43.490 --> 00:08:46.750
She was the daughter of Dr. Fritz Kaiser.

00:08:47.330 --> 00:08:49.790
She's that girl right there, Aisha.

00:09:03.300 --> 00:09:05.390
You're pretty damn good.

00:09:05.760 --> 00:09:07.930
But this'll settle it!

00:09:31.040 --> 00:09:33.380
Damn, he changed his sword style!

00:09:36.130 --> 00:09:36.880
I can do it.

00:09:42.340 --> 00:09:45.630
You're good, Lupin III.

00:09:47.010 --> 00:09:48.550
You're...

00:09:48.550 --> 00:09:52.350
You're late, Minerva's Owl.

00:09:53.060 --> 00:09:56.230
You told me to kill Mine Fujiko.

00:09:56.230 --> 00:09:59.730
It was an order from Aisha.

00:10:00.110 --> 00:10:02.490
However, that's not the whole story.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:04.740
There was another meaning to it, right?

00:10:05.910 --> 00:10:08.660
Due to a mass chemical leak accident,

00:10:08.660 --> 00:10:11.490
that town, along with its people, was deserted.

00:10:12.240 --> 00:10:13.410
However...

00:10:14.040 --> 00:10:17.040
...that day, from Eulenspiegel,

00:10:17.040 --> 00:10:24.380
Master evacuated his scientists and a few of the test subjects to this castle.

00:10:24.800 --> 00:10:30.220
Then, after staging an accident to kill Dr. Fritz Kaiser,

00:10:30.220 --> 00:10:34.310
he performed private experiments on Milady.

00:10:35.140 --> 00:10:40.060
He subjected girls to a variety of mental burdens,

00:10:40.060 --> 00:10:43.230
chose the ones that induced desirable responses,

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:47.200
and applied their equivalent to Milady's brain.

00:10:48.360 --> 00:10:55.000
That was all to create a holy maiden of his own.

00:10:56.370 --> 00:10:59.790
It's God that creates people.

00:11:00.290 --> 00:11:02.340
It's not that easy.

00:11:02.340 --> 00:11:03.550
Shut up.

00:11:03.550 --> 00:11:08.300
The frequent experiments led her to consciousness disorders

00:11:08.300 --> 00:11:10.590
and left her bedridden.

00:11:10.590 --> 00:11:12.300
Shut up. Shut up.

00:11:12.300 --> 00:11:13.810
And then...

00:11:17.350 --> 00:11:22.190
Milady, Master passed away this morning.

00:11:23.230 --> 00:11:27.320
There is no longer anyone to make you suffer.

00:11:27.900 --> 00:11:29.780
You're free to go ahead...

00:11:30.280 --> 00:11:32.410
and live your own life.

00:11:33.450 --> 00:11:36.080
Almeida won't die.

00:11:38.660 --> 00:11:40.920
The experiments can continue.

00:11:42.420 --> 00:11:47.590
Aisha continued the memory alteration experiments even after Almeida died?

00:11:47.590 --> 00:11:53.300
Indeed. Because Master stole her life,

00:11:53.300 --> 00:11:57.100
she had a strong obsession with others' lives.

00:11:58.230 --> 00:12:01.560
The life... of others...

00:12:01.560 --> 00:12:04.610
Don't say any more. Shut up.

00:12:19.160 --> 00:12:20.460
Everyone...

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:23.830
Oscar!

00:12:35.390 --> 00:12:38.020
Mi-ne-Fu-ji-ko.

00:12:39.560 --> 00:12:40.520
Oscar.

00:12:43.690 --> 00:12:45.980
Wait, where are you going?

00:12:50.360 --> 00:12:52.700
As she saw her death approaching,

00:12:52.700 --> 00:12:54.820
Shut up. Stop it.

00:12:54.820 --> 00:12:55.820
Shut up.

00:12:56.580 --> 00:13:00.330
she grew curious about her possibilities.

00:13:00.750 --> 00:13:06.880
So she made it seem as if Master were still alive,

00:13:06.880 --> 00:13:10.590
inserted her memories into other girls to

00:13:10.590 --> 00:13:13.510
plant the fear of Master in their minds,

00:13:13.510 --> 00:13:16.720
and checked how they lived afterward.

00:13:16.720 --> 00:13:17.600
However...

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.600
the results were horrific.

00:13:20.600 --> 00:13:22.310
The moment they were let loose,

00:13:22.310 --> 00:13:24.600
they'd become insane and commit suicide.

00:13:24.600 --> 00:13:29.980
None of them suggested a satisfactory possibility for Lady Aisha.

00:13:29.980 --> 00:13:36.240
During that time,
a woman came to this castle as a new maid.

00:13:37.120 --> 00:13:40.240
That was you, Mine Fujiko.

00:13:40.450 --> 00:13:43.250
Yeah, I remember now.

00:13:43.250 --> 00:13:46.540
I came to this castle as a maid.

00:13:47.040 --> 00:13:49.420
But I was soon subjected to the experiment.

00:13:50.590 --> 00:13:52.510
Upon your release to the outside world,

00:13:52.510 --> 00:13:56.800
you began to live a life that Milady yearned for.

00:13:56.800 --> 00:13:58.010
You enjoyed stealing,

00:13:58.430 --> 00:14:01.020
indulged in sex and so on.

00:14:01.390 --> 00:14:03.770
A thief was a possibility we didn't expect,

00:14:03.770 --> 00:14:06.520
but Milady was happy to see it.

00:14:06.520 --> 00:14:12.940
However, when she realized that you forcefully sealed away your past,

00:14:12.940 --> 00:14:18.660
Milady developed hatred towards you and tried to revive your past memories.

00:14:18.660 --> 00:14:22.700
Gradually, too, so that you may suffer.

00:14:23.410 --> 00:14:25.160
But because of him...

00:14:25.160 --> 00:14:30.670
...she even recovered her true
memories alongside the fake ones.

00:14:34.800 --> 00:14:36.670
Let me tell you something.

00:14:37.300 --> 00:14:39.760
I came here as a maid,

00:14:39.760 --> 00:14:42.420
but that was only on the surface.

00:14:43.260 --> 00:14:45.440
My intention was to steal the Dizzy treasure.

00:14:47.430 --> 00:14:53.360
Yes, I remember how, before my memories were overwritten,

00:14:53.360 --> 00:14:59.000
I found out that Almeida
was behind the Fraulein Eule cult.

00:14:59.000 --> 00:15:02.700
Since I'd be seducing someone either way, why not go for the big fish?

00:15:03.910 --> 00:15:06.160
That's what I thought, but...

00:15:06.160 --> 00:15:11.000
Well, it's more charming for a woman to mess up from time to time, I guess.

00:15:13.630 --> 00:15:14.720
Aisha.

00:15:15.260 --> 00:15:18.260
What you saw wasn't your possibility.

00:15:18.260 --> 00:15:23.220
I've always been stealing things and indulging in sex.

00:15:24.060 --> 00:15:26.680
Regardless of the fake past imposed on me,

00:15:26.680 --> 00:15:28.980
I'll always be who I am.

00:15:29.560 --> 00:15:32.980
That's the woman named Mine Fujiko.

00:15:35.030 --> 00:15:37.490
Bad girls will be punished.

00:15:37.490 --> 00:15:40.950
Punished, punished, punished...

00:15:40.950 --> 00:15:42.620
Mine Fujiko, today is your death day.

00:15:42.620 --> 00:15:44.950
Punish, punish...

00:15:44.950 --> 00:15:48.120
Punish... Punish...

00:15:48.120 --> 00:15:49.330
Punish...

00:15:51.040 --> 00:15:53.540
Bad girls will be punished.

00:15:54.670 --> 00:15:58.300
Bad girls need to be burnt!

00:16:15.480 --> 00:16:16.440
Damn it!

00:16:18.110 --> 00:16:20.150
What on earth is going on?

00:16:21.660 --> 00:16:23.030
Put out the fire!

00:16:23.030 --> 00:16:25.120
Protect Milady, protect Aisha!

00:16:25.120 --> 00:16:26.030
You got it.

00:16:28.120 --> 00:16:29.160
Wait, Lupin!

00:16:29.160 --> 00:16:30.620
Why are you stopping me?

00:16:30.620 --> 00:16:32.750
I'm honoring your request.

00:16:34.130 --> 00:16:37.920
When you told me to kill Mine Fujiko,
you actually meant...

00:16:37.920 --> 00:16:41.010
you wanted me to end this story.

00:16:41.010 --> 00:16:42.550
Isn't that right, Minerva?

00:16:52.390 --> 00:16:53.980
Are you...

00:16:53.980 --> 00:16:58.940
Yes, the one person that wasn't mentioned in that oh-so-dramatic confession:

00:16:58.940 --> 00:17:01.200
Aisha's mother.

00:17:01.950 --> 00:17:05.700
You were a scientist that experimented in the facility with Dr. Kritz,

00:17:05.700 --> 00:17:10.700
yet your name wasn't on the list of
researchers who died in that incident.

00:17:12.000 --> 00:17:17.880
I must say that I'm embarrassed I didn't
realize you're a lady until that close contact.

00:17:22.720 --> 00:17:24.050
A voice changer!

00:17:24.050 --> 00:17:26.720
I had no choice.

00:17:27.510 --> 00:17:30.970
Unaware of Almeida's filthy intentions,

00:17:30.970 --> 00:17:33.740
my husband willingly offered
our daughter to the experiment.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:36.610
Why didn't you stop him?

00:17:37.440 --> 00:17:39.150
I was scared.

00:17:40.860 --> 00:17:47.120
And after Almeida's death, you fulfilled
Aisha's wishes as some kind of atonement?

00:17:49.870 --> 00:17:51.450
Aisha...

00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.290
Then, till the day we meet again...

00:17:59.290 --> 00:18:02.010
take care!

00:18:05.760 --> 00:18:06.840
Aisha!

00:18:07.800 --> 00:18:09.810
We'll be taking Aisha with us.

00:18:10.760 --> 00:18:11.560
Got it?

00:18:12.140 --> 00:18:13.640
What if I refuse?

00:18:14.480 --> 00:18:16.440
What right do you have?

00:18:17.020 --> 00:18:21.150
You didn't do anything when your daughter was being traumatized.

00:18:21.150 --> 00:18:23.570
You have no right to call yourself her mother.

00:18:24.820 --> 00:18:27.570
All you did was ruin Aisha's life story.

00:18:28.780 --> 00:18:34.040
You couldn't even be a kind mother to her.

00:18:38.290 --> 00:18:45.510
Please take good care of my daughter—I mean, Lady Aisha.

00:18:54.270 --> 00:18:55.270
Aisha!

00:18:55.270 --> 00:18:56.520
Are you seeing this?

00:18:58.270 --> 00:19:00.360
This is the world!

00:19:00.360 --> 00:19:03.610
This is your world that
you're seeing through your own eyes!

00:19:03.610 --> 00:19:06.650
But you can't do anything!

00:19:10.120 --> 00:19:12.450
There's more, Aisha!

00:19:15.790 --> 00:19:17.080
Look!

00:19:18.920 --> 00:19:21.000
This is my world!

00:19:21.000 --> 00:19:22.340
I am free!

00:19:41.440 --> 00:19:43.400
You're a cruel woman.

00:19:43.940 --> 00:19:47.360
She didn't have long to live when she left that place.

00:19:47.360 --> 00:19:50.530
It would've been kinder to just kill her right away.

00:19:51.490 --> 00:19:54.410
I stopped killing.

00:19:54.410 --> 00:19:55.370
Oh?

00:19:56.500 --> 00:19:59.120
I'll give you a treasure,

00:19:59.120 --> 00:20:02.880
the freedom that you wanted.

00:20:07.340 --> 00:20:10.840
Oh yeah, didn't you come with Jigen?

00:20:10.840 --> 00:20:12.300
Are you leaving him behind?

00:20:12.300 --> 00:20:13.510
I guess.

00:20:14.050 --> 00:20:16.930
God, that guy's a beast.

00:20:19.600 --> 00:20:21.140
Does this mean game set?

00:20:21.140 --> 00:20:22.480
Looks like it.

00:20:23.310 --> 00:20:26.110
I hope I never have to fight you again.

00:20:42.960 --> 00:20:45.920
Lupin, weren't you going to steal me?

00:20:46.670 --> 00:20:49.720
You're too sentimental today.

00:20:49.720 --> 00:20:54.390
What I want is the crazy side of you that can relieve my boredom.

00:20:54.390 --> 00:20:55.720
I see.

00:20:55.720 --> 00:20:57.640
Then see you!

00:21:01.180 --> 00:21:03.980
You know what? Your sentimental side is fine, too.

00:21:03.980 --> 00:21:06.400
Mine Fujiko or should I say...

00:21:07.980 --> 00:21:09.480
<i>My</i> Fujiko!
